		<descript>
			<abstract>Boundary of Dry Tortugas National Park.</abstract>
			<purpose>Mapping, depiction of park boundary.</purpose>
			<supplinf> Procedures_Used: Created ascii text file of buoy marker
    locations of park boundary via ArcInfo GENERATE command.  With
    GENERATE command, created line file connecting buoy markers to form
    enclosed polygon of park boundary. Revisions: Original.
    Reviews_Applied_to_Data: Overlaid with BUOYS coverage and previously
    digitized file of park boundary to ensure match.
    Related_Spatial_and_Tabular_Data_Sets: None. Other_References_Cited:
    None. Notes: Taken from buoy locations as seen/listed on official
    Dry Tortugas National Park brochure map. </supplinf>
